pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |-
  随机森林客观赋权：避免主观赋权干扰；OOB 打乱置换衡量指标重要性。
  权重排序：高速时长占比 > 车速均值 > 急加速时长 > 能量回收占比 > 加速度均值 > 车速标准差 > 加速度标准差。
elements:
  - elementId: chapter-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 960, 56]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: chapter-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 11, 720, 34]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 24
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: '02. 数据与方法 —— 随机森林赋权'
  - elementId: chapter-brand
    elementType: text
    bounds: [736, 20, 176, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 8.8
      color: "$accent6"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: EV RANGE · 学术报告
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 70, 864, 34]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 用 OOB 置换，把“谁更影响能耗”变成客观权重
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 104, 864, 16]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 9.6
      wrap: false
      text: 7 项指标输入随机森林，输出对驱动电机能耗的权重系数 w_i
  - elementId: why-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 132, 300, 176]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
    shadow: { blur: 10, color: "#1F5FBF14", offset: [0, 2] }
  - elementId: why-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 146, 264, 16]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      fontSize: 8.6
      wrap: false
      text: 为什么客观赋权
  - elementId: why-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 168, 264, 126]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.7
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 为避免主观赋权引入人为干扰，采用随机森林评估指标重要性：集成决策树、泛化性强、计算复杂度低，可处理较高维数据并输出特征重要性。
  - elementId: rf-split
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 262, 264, 36]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 8.4
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: 有效数据按 7:3 划分训练 / 测试，训练后得到各指标对驱动电机能耗的权重系数 w<sub>i</sub>。
  - elementId: oob-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 320, 300, 146]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primarySoft" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primaryTint" }
  - elementId: oob-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 334, 264, 16]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      fontSize: 8.6
      wrap: false
      text: 重要性度量（OOB 置换）
  - elementId: oob-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 354, 264, 48]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.2
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: 打乱指标 X<sub>p</sub> 的取值序列重新预测，MSE 增量越大越重要；对全部 I 棵树取平均。
  - elementId: vim-formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 410, 264, 34]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$text"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |-
        <p>\(VIM_p = \frac{1}{I}\sum_{i=1}^{I} mse_i^p\)</p>
  - elementId: fig-9-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [368, 132, 544, 248]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
    shadow: { blur: 12, color: "#1F5FBF14", offset: [0, 3] }
  - elementId: fig-9
    elementType: image
    bounds: [372, 136, 536, 208]
    src: media/fig09_rf.jpg
    fit: { mode: contain }
  - elementId: fig-9-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [372, 348, 536, 26]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 8.2
      text: |-
        <p><span style="color:$accent;font-weight:bold;">图 9</span>　随机森林框架：训练集随机采样建立 i 棵决策树，测试集结果取均值输出能耗预测</p>
  - elementId: fig-10-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [368, 390, 200, 76]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [14000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: fig-10
    elementType: image
    bounds: [372, 393, 192, 60]
    src: media/fig10_weights.jpg
    fit: { mode: contain }
  - elementId: fig-10-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [368, 468, 200, 12]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 7.4
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        <p><span style="color:$accent;font-weight:bold;">图 10</span>　评价指标权重系数</p>
  - elementId: rank-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [580, 390, 332, 76]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [14000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primarySoft" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primaryTint" }
  - elementId: rank-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [594, 398, 304, 62]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 8.4
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |-
        <p><strong>1</strong> 高速时长占比　<strong>2</strong> 车速均值　<strong>3</strong> 急加速时长</p>
        <p><strong>4</strong> 能量回收占比　<strong>5</strong> 加速度均值</p>
        <p><strong>6</strong> 车速标准差　<strong>7</strong> 加速度标准差</p>
  - elementId: footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 502, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 507, 640, 12]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      wrap: false
      text: 基于驾驶行为量化特征的电动汽车剩余续驶里程预测 · 《新能源车辆工程学报》
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [800, 506, 112, 14]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 8.5
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 07 / 15
